			"notes": "- Bauble modifiers now show up correctly in tooltips for all Baubles\n- DDD now supports metadata in its config for items, armors and shields. It also supports metatdata for projectiles when linking projectile distributions to appear on the tooltips for certain items.\n- DDD now better reports config reading errors that cause exceptions.\n- DDD ends damage calculations early when the damage becomes zero to mimic vanilla behaviour. This can be turned off in the config if another mod changes that behaviour.\n- DDD now throws a warning when trying to apply armor attribute modifiers off a mob during damage calculations where it already had existing armor attribute modifiers added by DDD already. DDD will remove the old attribute modifiers in that case as well."
		},
